    rcases eq_or_ne i x with rfl | hi
    · simp only [update_self, h1K₁]
    · simp only [update_of_ne hi, h1K]
  · intro i
    rcases eq_or_ne i x with rfl | hi
    · simp only [update_self, h2K₁]
    · simp only [update_of_ne hi, h2K]
  · simp only [Finset.set_biUnion_insert_update _ hx, hK, h3K]

